-- The orientation-preserving isometries of ℝ³ as the bundled group of
-- pairs (M, t) acting by x ↦ M x + t, with SO3 embedded compatibly
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Passmore.
